`Handover.report` now adds up to three lines after the `events:` line, taking events from the end of the internal `events` array: the one added last comes first, then the one before it, then the one before that. Handovers with fewer events get one line each, and an empty one gets none. Order follows when events were added, not the time on them.

I couldn't see `log` (line 532), so I'm assuming it appends to `this.events`. If it inserts or sorts by time, this would pick the wrong events.
